            "question": "What makes a fabric suitable for high-traffic public spaces?",
            "answer": "<p>Public-space upholstery has to take constant use without showing wear. A suitable fabric needs heavy-duty abrasion resistance, a surface that resists scratches and stains, easy cleaning between users and compliance with contract fire-safety standards. Monteiro's public space fabrics are heavy-duty coated fabrics that meet all of these demands while remaining REACH-compliant.</p>"
