            "answer": "<p>They are coated fabrics rated for intensive, contract-grade use, so they stand up to the repeated rubbing and contact typical of busy public seating. The non-absorbent surface also resists scratches and surface marking, helping the upholstery keep its appearance over years of service.</p>"
